-- =====================================================================
-- CampusConnect - demo data (realistic clubs, events, students and registrations)
-- Import AFTER database.sql (new install) or sprint2_upgrade.sql (existing database):
--   phpMyAdmin > campusconnect > Import > demo_data.sql > Go
-- Event dates are relative to the moment of import (Asia/Riyadh time), so re-import it
-- before a demo to refresh the 24-hour reminders. Re-importing is safe: it first removes
-- only the demo accounts below (their clubs, events and registrations are removed by
-- ON DELETE CASCADE) and the old "[TEST]" accounts. Other data is never touched.
--
-- Password for every demo account:  Campus@2026
--   Club leaders: noura.alshehri@pnu.edu.sa (Software Engineering Club, Volunteering Club)
--                 haya.alotaibi@pnu.edu.sa  (Arabic Literature Club)
--                 dana.alsubaie@pnu.edu.sa  (Photography Club)
--                 rahaf.alenazi@pnu.edu.sa  (Health & Wellness Club)
--   Students:     sara.alqahtani@pnu.edu.sa (main student account), lama.aldosari, reem.alzahrani,
--                 joud.alharthi, ghada.almutairi, nouf.alshammari, shatha.alanazi,
--                 wejdan.albaqami, amal.alghamdi, razan.alrashidi  (all @pnu.edu.sa)
-- =====================================================================
